Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 23:15:25 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] agent_ui: pop-out focused view for a single same-session
 subagent

Add a per-subagent focused transcript: the group card gains an "Open" button that
focuses the thread on that subagent's subtree, showing only its members plus a
breadcrumb bar to return. Realized as a visibility filter over the existing
ListState (focused mode shows only the subtree; normal mode hides members), so no
list-state surgery and the focused root renders as a plain summary rather than a
nested group card.

Verified: cargo check -p agent_ui (0 errors; warning count unchanged from baseline).
Runtime/visual verification with a live qwen --acp session still pending.

